                 <h3>Acharya Suvendu, professional KP astrologer and modern day life coach, having 18 years of experience in astrology and good knowledge. He is awarded with Gold medal by AARI, KOLKATA.</h3>
                 <hr class="short" />
             </div>
             <div class="col-md-12 col-lg-12">
                 <p>He has completed his college in Electronics and Communication engineering, got the degree of masters in Astrology. Nowadays engaging his time for M. Phil in Astrology and advance methods of KP astrology. Has also learnt "Krishnamuti Paddhati (K.P.System)" from Late Sunil Gondhalkar ji (founder of Four step theory) and Sri Krishna Kr Bagri sir (Direct disciple of Hasbe ji). Strongly interested in Occult subjects i.e. astrology and numerology. </p>
             </div>
             <div class="col-md-12 col-lg-12">
                 <p class="d-none d-md-block">Always keeps his eyes to find the root of any problems and his untiring search, interest, quest for knowledge and destiny, brought him to the right destination. He follows the path of Late Sri Ashok Roy, inventor of “Bhava sphut system". He is closely associated with Dr. Bikash Raha who is one of the successful followers of Krishnamurty Paddhati (K.P.System). He also has well versed knowledge in Horary astrology or Prashna Chakra (A Divine science invented by Late Sothidamannan K.S Krishnamurty ji).</p>

             </div>
             <div class="col-md-12 col-lg-12">
                 <p class="d-none d-md-block">Acharya Suvendu provides the services of general predictions on Education, Marriage, Relationships, Health, Financial Status & Profession / Job / Business, Trading and Gambling.  He also does predictions for the persons who don't have accurate birth details and answers the various questions about life which are based on Prashna Chakra (Horary). By his excellent astrological experience he helps people to understand the deeper truths about their problems and provides meaningful insights and guidance for their future betterment. He also gives his time on one to one sessions for helping people to overcome the negativities like anxiety, fear, confusion, depression, stress etc and making them stable in mind, empowered and confident.</p>

             </div>
